briefing = GDI has intercepted and captured one of our MCVs. We were counting on that vehicle to establish a foothold in the area. Recover the MCV and remove any trace that GDI had ever been there.

recover-mcv-and-eliminate-gdi = Recover the MCV and eliminate GDI.
village-diversion = Create a diversion in the village to draw GDI forces away.
power-down = Cut GDI base power.

villagers-running = The villagers are running to the GDI base for help.
mammoths-responding = GDI's Mammoth tanks are leaving the base entrance to investigate the village.
tech-center-captured = Tech Center captured. Two Apache gunships are en route.
ion-cannon-online = Warning: the GDI Ion Cannon is now online.
ion-cannon-destroyed = The GDI Ion Cannon has been disabled.
